    {
      "id": "6a8ba1a878906ec871c68329",
      "text": "血鎖の一護",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787535786,
      "updated": 1787535786
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ba1aa0000000000f51dc8",
      "text": "[https://youtu.be/-1alhxkbDUA?si=evQvIUE-6_G6GjRh]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787535786,
      "updated": 1787535786
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ba1aa0000000000f51dc9",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787535786,
      "updated": 1787535786
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ba1aa0000000000f51dca",
      "text": "[黒崎一護]の[アニメオリジナル]の姿",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787535786,
      "updated": 1787535786
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ba1aa0000000000f51dcb",
      "text": "\t自らの内に眠る虚の血を呼び覚まし、『半虚化』した黒崎一護が[卍解]し、斬魄刀と共に変化した究極の姿。",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787535786,
      "updated": 1787535786
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ba1aa0000000000f51dcc",
      "text": "\tキャラクターデザイン・命名：[久保帯人]（原作・監修）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787535786,
      "updated": 1787535786
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ba1aa0000000000f51dcd",
      "text": "\t[BLEACH 千年血戦篇-禍進譚-]で登場",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787535786,
      "updated": 1787535786
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ba1aa0000000000f51dce",
      "text": "\t\t登場話は全体が完全新規（原作にない）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787535786,
      "updated": 1787535829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ba1aa0000000000f51dcf",
      "text": "\t\t大筋は変わらないがアニメオリジナル展開が多い",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787535786,
      "updated": 1787535786
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ba1aa0000000000f51dd0",
